      "section": "news",
      "kind": "news",
      "title": "With an approval apiece, the verdict is still out on AbbVie’s and BMS’ twin neuro buys",
      "summary": "출처 피드 발췌 (원문 언어 · 분석 전): After emraclidine’s schizophrenia fail and Cobenfy’s laggard launch, it’s too early to know who made the better buy: AbbVie, in its $8.7 billion Cerevel takeover in late 2023, or Bristol Myers Squibb, which spent $14 billion for Karuna just two weeks later.",
